Title: BREACH POINT
Author: Marcus Cole
Draft date: June 2026

FADE IN:


INT. SAFE HOUSE - NIGHT

Santos spreads blueprints. Three hostages circled in red beneath the embassy.
SANTOS
Journalists. No ransom demand. Someone wants them quiet.

INT. EMBASSY ANNEX - SECURITY HUB - NIGHT

Thermal feeds. CAPTAIN RICO SANTOS watches guard patterns repeat.
SANTOS
Breath at 0400. Two minutes in, ninety out.

INT. ROOFTOP STAGING - NIGHT

VEGA, PARK, OSEI prep gear. RED FLARE CANISTER on Vega's vest.
VEGA
Rotation shifts early. Blind spot closes in six.

EXT. EMBASSY ALLEY - NIGHT

Osei disables a camera with a pellet. Santos signals — move.

INT. EMBASSY BASEMENT - NIGHT

Breaching charge blows. Santos enters low — targets neutralized.
SANTOS
Eyes on me. Walk, don't run.

INT. BASEMENT CORRIDOR - NIGHT

Hostages move. A locked service door blocks the exit route.
PARK
Street exit is sealed!

INT. STAIRWELL - NIGHT

Gunfire from above. Park suppresses. Osei shields the civilians.
SANTOS
Roof. Plan B. Move.

INT. UPPER FLOOR - NIGHT

Santos clears corners — two more hostiles, disarmed fast.
HOSTAGE #1
They said if anyone came, we'd—
SANTOS
You're not dying in a basement. Keep moving.

EXT. EMBASSY ROOFTOP - NIGHT

RED FLARE arcs skyward. Rotors beat closer.
VEGA
Bird's inbound. Thirty seconds!

EXT. EMBASSY ROOFTOP - NIGHT

Hostages aboard. Santos climbs last, rounds snapping past his helmet. The helicopter lifts — city blurring below.
SANTOS
Count them. All three. Then tell me who ordered this.

FADE OUT.


THE END
